<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1675233532"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:31.111"><div begin="12.273" end="33.083" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="12.273" end="17.318" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.273" end="13.132">从那</span><span begin="13.132" end="14.360">遥远海</span><span begin="14.360" end="14.870">边</span> <span begin="14.987" end="15.947">慢慢消</span><span begin="15.947" end="16.580">失</span><span begin="16.580" end="16.981">的</span><span begin="16.981" end="17.318">你</span></p><p begin="17.533" end="22.384" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.533" end="18.561">本来模</span><span begin="18.561" end="19.143">糊</span><span begin="19.143" end="19.430">的</span><span begin="19.430" end="19.893">脸</span> <span begin="19.990" end="20.692">竟然</span><span begin="20.692" end="21.161">渐</span><span begin="21.161" end="21.535">渐</span><span begin="21.535" end="21.917">清</span><span begin="21.917" end="22.384">晰</span></p><p begin="22.496" end="27.505" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.496" end="23.209">想要</span><span begin="23.209" end="24.103">说些</span><span begin="24.103" end="24.524">什</span><span begin="24.524" end="25.169">么</span> <span begin="25.169" end="26.412">又不知从</span><span begin="26.412" end="26.718">何</span><span begin="26.718" end="27.091">说</span><span begin="27.091" end="27.505">起</span></p><p begin="27.720" end="33.083" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.720" end="28.821">只有把</span><span begin="28.821" end="29.276">它</span><span begin="29.428" end="29.762">放</span><span begin="29.762" end="30.415">在</span><span begin="30.722" end="31.269">心</span><span begin="31.269" end="33.083">底</span></p></div><div begin="35.231" end="56.198" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="35.231" end="40.134" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.231" end="36.006">茫然</span><span begin="36.006" end="36.506">走</span><span begin="36.506" end="36.917">在</span><span begin="36.917" end="37.334">海</span><span begin="37.33